<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Data in line with inflation targets-Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Data in line with inflation targets-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday that gross domestic domestic (GDP) data for the September quarter was consistent with the government's inflation targets.</p>
</text>
